WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:04.040
Just being at your side,

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:16.160
Gentles my hearts to the point of disbelief

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:25.570
I thought I heard the sound of your footsteps behind me,

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:35.720
I turned my head repeatedly, wishing you would appear...

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:41.740
...and then there you were

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:50.990
The beginning of a new love

00:00:51.310 --> 00:01:05.870
Is unknowingly, the beginning of our invisible love story

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:15.360
Hence, I shall never leave your side

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:24.540
I pledge to love you and only you

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:40.710
<i>Sunday: Chise looked like</i> <i>she was really enjoying herself.</i>

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.160
A date. A real date...!

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:49.420
<i>I didn't tell her I'd seen</i> <i>Fuyumi that day.</i>

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:52.600
It's not fair to her or your husband!

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:56.270
Just for a little while... Lie down beside me...

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:02.140
I'm leaving.

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:09.250
<i>I knew who it was I loved.</i> <i>I knew it was Chise,</i>

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:13.690
<i>and that my first love didn't matter now.</i>

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:17.780
Shuji, hurry!

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:22.020
<i>I just want to keep seeing her smile.</i>

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:28.030
I lost my wallet.

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:35.200
"Fuyumi"

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:37.810
This way!

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:42.750
Sorry it's so far.

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:45.950
It's OK.

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:48.350
I've got good eyes.

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:50.280
Look, a sea lion!

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:52.260
And a dolphin!

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:56.630
Here.

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:01.070
Sorry, Shuji.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:07.000
When I lost my wallet, I gave up on seeing the sea lions.

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:09.340
Dummy! Who cares about that?

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:16.520
But you shouldn't have made me hold all the money.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:22.950
This happened because you lost your wallet.

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:27.430
I'm leaving.

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:34.570
So it's my fault.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.100
Sorry.

00:03:37.410 --> 00:03:38.090
Dummy!

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:45.410
But this really has been fun.

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:48.080
We can come again, right?

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:50.120
Sure we can!

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:01.290
Chise, let's take a photo.

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:05.670
We don't have any together yet.

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:07.730
No photos...

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:10.470
But...

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:17.280
But if we have a photo it's like we don't need to try anymore.

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:25.280
While I can still be here, I want you to look at the real me!

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:30.320
I want you to tell me...

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:34.060
that I'm really still here.

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:37.550
I want you...

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:40.140
to make me believe...

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:42.930
that I'm not alone.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:55.580
At least you didn't have to scramble today.

00:04:57.720 --> 00:05:00.780
Actually, I didn't bring my pager.

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:04.230
It's our first date, after all.

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:07.760
I didn't want any interruptions.

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:10.330
Shuji...

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:14.030
Was that wrong of me?

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:18.610
Of course not! It'll be fine!

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:22.940
They're not fighting anywhere today. Don't worry.

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:29.450
That's right. There might be days like that.

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:33.950
Besides, everyone goes on dates!

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:37.180
At least any normal high-school girl does!

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:39.930
"Normal"?

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:42.960
Sure! There's nothing wrong with you.

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:46.230
It's peaceful everywhere today, just like here.

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:55.210
This town is peaceful because I live here.

00:05:57.150 --> 00:06:00.310
There is no peace anywhere else.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:04.650
These days, bigger cities than this...

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:09.320
can just vanish in a second.

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:11.460
Chise...

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:24.870
<i>Chise's body was so cold...</i>

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:27.380
<i>it made you want to cry...</i>

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:31.610
<i>How much of her was</i> <i>still human?</i>

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:37.820
<i>Her neck was so thin,</i> <i>and her hair smelled so nice...</i>

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:52.630
Sorry, Shuji.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:55.330
Looks like they found me.

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:59.000
I have to go.

00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:07.080
No, Shuji! No...

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:10.220
Sorry. Be strong, OK?

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:12.190
I'll be fine.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.120
What's wrong with me?!

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:38.910
What?

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:44.550
Oh yeah, I have to get my wallet. That's all.

00:07:58.830 --> 00:07:59.680
Shuji!

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:04.000
I just came by to get my wallet.

00:08:09.410 --> 00:08:14.480
You've matured so much, letting a woman use your arm as a pillow...

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:16.980
Yeah...

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:18.620
G'night!

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:55.820
Shuji, are you crying?

00:08:57.960 --> 00:09:00.960
Sorry, did I do something...?

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:05.530
No...

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:09.670
it's just that...

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:13.040
why does everything I do...

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:17.820
end up hurting Chise?!

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:22.310
I'm her boyfriend! So why do I make her cry?!

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:29.720
We decided together... that we'd fall in love!

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:33.180
Why can't I protect her?!

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:38.160
None of it's her fault...

00:09:40.110 --> 00:09:42.270
but<i>....</i> It's not mine, either.

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:46.200
I don't know what to do!

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:50.070
What should I do?

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:56.010
I love Chise!

00:09:56.760 --> 00:09:58.120
I love her!

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:01.920
<i>I heard Chise's</i> <i>sad sounding voice.</i>

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:10.830
<i>Even now,</i>

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:13.630
<i>is she somewhere crying?</i>

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:23.340
Hup!

00:10:29.590 --> 00:10:32.030
Thank-ow! Why'd you get it hot?!

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:33.980
My mistake.

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:36.980
If Chise did that, you'd probably laugh and forgive her, huh?

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:50.530
Shuji, hurry up and do it with Chise. You'll both feel at ease.

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.840
You're both so awkward.

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:57.200
What's it to you?

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:01.380
I'm such a fool.

00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:05.850
Chise's out again today.

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:08.690
She's always been sickly.

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:14.450
In grade school she was sent to a hospital in Tokyo for months.

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:19.130
And she was clumsy and didn't have many friends.

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:25.510
So I promised her I'd look out for her.

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:32.510
I told her she could always rely on me, telling her to cheer up.

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:36.550
I'll give you this.

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:39.350
I can't stand to see...

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:42.020
how you sit in class staring...

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:44.520
at Chise's empty chair.

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:45.960
I do not!

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:52.160
So keep it! Forget about that other old picture you carry around.

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:56.060
Thanks, I will.

00:11:56.820 --> 00:12:00.400
You can scratch me out of it if you like...

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:38.260
...you should've seen that girl!

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:41.990
Excuse me...

00:12:43.640 --> 00:12:45.500
could I have some water?

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:49.270
Aren't you...

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:52.870
I'm sorry! Forget it!

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:55.680
It's Chise in the flesh!

00:12:55.980 --> 00:12:57.450
You're incredible!

00:12:58.150 --> 00:13:01.970
That battle was amazing! Such power!

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:03.230
Ow!

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:07.660
That's no way to talk to a superior officer!

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:12.220
Commander, I apologize for my men.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.330
Squad Leader Tetsu...

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:20.130
I told you to stop calling me that.

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:23.570
Lieutenant, the radar's no good.

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:28.210
Their jamming is too strong. ECCM is also out.

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:30.850
We don't know how many there are.

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:34.260
This is bad. It's like warfare a century ago.

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:39.290
But didn't Commander Chise wipe them all out?

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:40.830
We can only hope so.

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:41.920
No, I didn't!

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:44.620
Don't be so modest!

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:45.560
Nakamura!

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:50.600
No, I can sense them.

00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:54.210
The enemy's out there.

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:59.610
Lots of them. We're kind of surrounded.

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:05.010
Don't worry. I'll take care of them.

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:08.120
Here.

00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:08.910
Thanks.

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:16.720
That medicine looks pretty strong.

00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:21.890
Thank you for the water.

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:31.580
I'm sorry, but in the last battle, I actually let a lot of them escape.

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:35.470
There were so many...

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:38.040
I was afraid if I let go with too much power...

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:43.110
I might even vaporize this city.

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:46.660
Atsushi.

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:48.450
You're late.

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:49.590
Sorry.

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:54.590
Is that Yukari?

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:55.630
Probably.

00:15:03.770 --> 00:15:05.070
What're you doing?!

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:08.200
Chise says she has a boyfriend!

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:11.450
What's he like? Is he more handsome than me?

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:13.860
Dummy! Straighten up!

00:15:17.590 --> 00:15:22.360
"Handsome," I don't know. More like, "intimidating".

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:25.880
You mean like Squad Leader Tetsu?

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:26.820
Why you!

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:27.560
Yes!

00:15:28.810 --> 00:15:29.840
Really?!

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:32.270
I envy you...

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:33.960
Dummy!

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:36.240
I'm sorry!

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:40.450
It's just that you say "dummy" the same way.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:41.910
"Dummy"?

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:46.880
This being an ultimate weapon has made me into...

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:48.880
a real delinquent.

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:55.360
My family doesn't know. I skip school, sneak out at night...

00:15:55.860 --> 00:16:01.420
Everyone's given up on me. They don't care what I do.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:08.840
But Shuji's the only one who'll still scold me.

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:15.140
When I do something wrong, he always says that: "Dummy!"

00:16:16.480 --> 00:16:22.720
Even though I'm a weapon, and I kill lots of people...

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:26.480
I'm a bad person, but still...

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:29.260
he thinks enough of me to call me "dummy."

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:32.850
Does he know you're the ultimate weapon?

00:16:34.900 --> 00:16:38.530
Yes. He saw me during the Sapporo raid.

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:45.470
When he scolds me, for a moment I can believe...

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:48.570
that I'm still human...

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:51.510
that it's still OK for me to live.

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:57.480
Well, I think your fighting is...

00:16:57.560 --> 00:16:59.000
really important!

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:04.350
Please look at me! I'm alive!

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:07.020
I almost died in the last battle!

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:10.590
But because you were there...

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:15.630
It means something, that I fight?

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:17.640
That's right!

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:20.060
I'd have been killed long ago!

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:21.110
Stop it!

00:17:22.150 --> 00:17:23.380
Sorry.

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:27.350
It's OK. I'm glad.

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:30.350
Lately, I've been getting...

00:17:30.850 --> 00:17:34.830
more control over my power.

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:38.450
It used to scare me.

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:42.930
My mind would go blank, and my body just acted on its own.

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:45.100
Until recently...

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:50.000
if I wiped out some foreign city...

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:54.940
it would really bother me, but now...

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:59.480
I'm getting used to it, and if I can take it...

00:17:59.590 --> 00:18:03.720
I believe I can be of some use to people.

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:08.830
What are you saying?! Of course you're helping a lot!

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:10.490
I feel the same way!

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:13.830
Without you, our country would be...

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.690
That's enough!

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:18.000
You talk too much.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:19.560
But...

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:24.580
And Commander, you should not be pouting.

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:26.540
Tactics are what...

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:27.410
Um...

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:28.350
What?

00:18:29.010 --> 00:18:32.880
The enemy is coming, with stealth weapons.

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:36.320
Oh no, are they targeting me?

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:38.700
They've locked on.

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:41.160
Please get out! Sorry!

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:42.310
Withdraw!

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:43.820
Hurry!

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:50.550
Chise!

00:18:52.200 --> 00:18:53.140
Chise?!

00:18:57.470 --> 00:18:59.840
It... it hurts!

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:09.210
They say the main island's been hit pretty hard.

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:10.360
Yeah.

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:12.480
Worse than Sapporo.

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:18.160
But you'd never guess, looking at such a beautiful sky.

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:22.160
This town's the picture of peace.

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:26.970
This town is peaceful because I live here.

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:33.570
Those are just rumors. Don't pay them any attention.

00:19:34.010 --> 00:19:34.980
Maybe.

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:39.840
But I just hope things stay peaceful here in this city.

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:41.240
Yeah.

00:19:43.710 --> 00:19:45.820
<i>If there really is meaning</i> <i>for me to fight,</i>

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:49.290
<i>then I would want...</i>

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:51.070
<i>to defend...</i>

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:57.130
<i>my father, mother, little brother,</i> <i>everyone in my town...</i>

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:01.900
<i>No, I want to use</i> <i>my power to protect...</i>

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:05.800
<i>as many people on</i> <i>this planet as I can.</i>

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:09.110
<i>And then maybe Shuji...</i>

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:10.150
Wow, Chise is cute!

00:20:10.150 --> 00:20:12.660
<i>might have words</i> <i>of praise for me.</i>
Wow, Chise is cute!

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:12.720
<i>might have words</i> <i>of praise for me.</i>

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:13.080
Of course she is.
<i>might have words</i> <i>of praise for me.</i>

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:14.020
Of course she is.

00:20:14.050 --> 00:20:14.820
Damn you're lucky to have a picture like that.

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:16.510
<i>Then maybe the distance...</i>

00:20:17.060 --> 00:20:20.160
<i>that's opened between us</i> <i>since that day...</i>

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:23.020
<i>I broke our promise to meet...</i>

00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:25.780
<i>will disappear, and we can be...</i>

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:27.760
<i>like we were before.</i>

00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:37.450
<i>So I'm going to try...</i>

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:42.480
<i>No, just a little bit...</i>

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:44.910
<i>harder.</i>

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:55.690
<i>I'll try harder.</i>

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:06.200
Got to hit them before they hit me...

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:08.270
Got to...

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:12.170
Got to protect everyone...

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:13.330
Shuji's got to...

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:16.040
have words of praise for me!

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:20.610
That's enough.

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:24.320
It's over.

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:28.380
Did I... again...

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:31.820
You did great.

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:37.830
Thank you.

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:43.870
Now I want... you to kill me.

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:50.820
I can't stand being like this any more.

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:53.780
I'm such a fool.

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:55.050
I'm a weapon now.

00:21:55.660 --> 00:21:58.950
It's stupid to think I could protect anything.

00:22:07.940 --> 00:22:13.170
<i>Is it stupid to want something</i> <i>precious to you not to change?</i>

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:17.610
<i>Is wanting something</i> <i>like this childish?</i>

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:21.410
<i>Chise's still just a</i> <i>high school girl...</i>

00:22:21.750 --> 00:22:26.150
<i>17 years old, small, normal...</i>

00:22:26.900 --> 00:22:28.950
<i>normal...</i>

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:43.420
A rift opened up upon my heart

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:49.990
And I went through the night sleepless, sighing constantly

00:22:50.670 --> 00:22:59.340
Before I realize, it's turned to morning

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:08.660
I want to hear your voice

00:23:09.180 --> 00:23:13.250
I want to feel your warmth

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:19.460
Thoughts of you well up within me

00:23:20.640 --> 00:23:25.310
And my tears begin to overflow

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:36.570
Goodbye my beloved, I am still unable to forget about you

00:23:36.730 --> 00:23:46.740
Having all of this end with just a single word of goodbye

00:23:47.240 --> 00:23:51.570
Fills me with sorrow

00:24:00.740 --> 00:24:03.180
Chise, how can you stand it?

00:24:03.290 --> 00:24:06.850
We're still in high school! Just a normal couple in love.

00:24:07.520 --> 00:24:10.250
There's still so much more I want to tell you, Chise!

00:24:10.690 --> 00:24:15.060
SAIKANO, Episode 5: "Liar"
